## 🚀 How to Run Locally / Import into Dify

1. Log into your [Dify Cloud](https://cloud.dify.ai) instance.
2. Navigate to **Studio ➔ Create from DSL / Import**.
3. Upload the DSL workflow file (`.yml`) for this project.
4. Configure your preferred model endpoints.
5. Click **Publish** and launch the preview or embedded chat.
